{% comment %}
  Wine finder for /le-mie-passioni/ — the primary interaction in the Degustando section,
  above the map (wine_map.liquid). Language is shared with the map via window.WineI18n
  (wine_i18n.liquid, included first).

  A: deterministic facet + keyword filter over _data/wines.yml. No dependencies,
     works offline, instant. Facets (type / region / price / occasion) and food
     tags are derived from the existing fields, with optional `occasions:` and
     `food_tags:` overrides in the YAML.
  B: optional semantic re-ranking via assets/js/wine_finder_semantic.js
     (transformers.js + all-MiniLM-L6-v2, loaded from CDN only after the visitor asks
     for it via "Migliora i suggerimenti"). Falls back to A if it can't load.

  Results: the top match is "La mia scelta" (prominent), the rest are "Altre buone
  scelte" (compact, with a match-strength meter). "Vedi sulla mappa" fires
  `winefinder:show`; "Scheda completa" fires `winefinder:sheet` — wine_map.liquid
  listens for both.
{% endcomment %}

<style>
